// prop_lab: fetched from TradingView 2026-10-08
// url: https://www.tradingview.com/script/wwi02rpz-Moving-Average-Band-Strategy/
// id: PUB;19e48adf5cf9498a9589c5839b0106c1  kind: strategy  likes: 1836
